            <ArticleTitle>Imaging of duodenal diverticula and their complications.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>20-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1067/j.cpradiol.2011.07.001</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Duodenal diverticula are common and are often incidentally found during routine imaging. Complications can occur but few require surgical intervention. We present a review of duodenal diverticula and their complications.</AbstractText>
